{"context_through_frame": 83200, "data_kind": "scripted_target_behavior", "example_id": "A001", "messages": [{"audio_id": "U01", "content": "我刚开始安排每周锻炼，想请教一下，休息日通常应该怎么留？", "role": "user"}], "response": {"audio_path": "audio/A001.wav", "audio_sha256": "e1a8b0312bb49cf92d8688a1865a183cdb95bc6eb17e6534fd6d0c6d097f638a", "content": "刚开始时，一般先给同一肌群约四十八小时恢复；不必每次训练后整天不动。不同肌群可以交替，强度较高或仍明显疲劳时再多休一天。", "frames": 207360, "role": "assistant", "sample_rate": 16000}, "schema": "duplex_v2.consumed_training_example.v1", "user_id": "U01"}
